# 团队级 AI 规则注入与架构约束(.rules)

## Mandatory (必须)
- layer: presentation / application / domain / infrastructure
- forbid_cross_layer: true

## Patterns (核心模式)
- provider_abstraction: BaseLLMProvider | BaseImageProvider
- structured_dm_contract: DMPlan { narrative, check, advance_scene }
- dice_contract: DiceRoll | CheckResult { skill, dc, total, success, degree }
- seeded_dice: roll_expression(expr, seed) for tests

## Safety (安全)
- api_key_secret: only in .env.example
- sanitize_input: before every user input
- scan_guardrails: prompt injection / jailbreak interception
- guard_log: sensitive content masked

## Persistence
- sessions: JSON documents in data/sessions/
- telemetry: SQLite check_log + session_metrics

## Git
- commit: Angular convention (feat/fix/test/docs/refactor/chore)
- branch_protection: main requires PR + review + green CI